        "subheading": "What we bring to Cologne",
        "title": "The sectors we specify for.",
        "title_size": 48,
        "title_width": 14,
        "heading_h1": false,
        "text": "<p>ORGATEC is where office and contract interiors are specified. We are bringing coated upholstery fabrics for the two sectors that matter most in Hall 10.2: <strong>office and contract furniture</strong>, and <strong>healthcare</strong>. Open a sector below to see the collections on the stand. Most of them you can sample today, free of charge.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "auto",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "enlarge_text": true,
        "full_width": false,
        "no_padding_bottom": true,
        "color_scheme": "standard"
      }
    },
    "sectors": {
      "type": "accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "office": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "briefcase",
            "title": "Office & contract furniture",
            "open": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Task and conference seating, soft seating, contract furniture.</strong> Heavy PVC-coated qualities with abrasion resistance up to 400.000 Martindale, Sanitized® antimicrobial finishes, flame-retardant certifications and a 10-year warranty on stock-service materials.</p><ul><li><strong>PU Office</strong> — <a href=\"/products/furna-collection\">Furna</a>, <a href=\"/products/mara-collection\">Mara</a>, <a href=\"/products/portus-collection\">Portus</a>, <a href=\"/products/elefante-collection\">Elefante</a>: sleek, durable office fabrics for stylish and comfortable workspaces.</li><li><strong>PVC Fabric Look</strong> — <a href=\"/products/straw-collection\">Straw</a>, <a href=\"/products/glam-collection\">Glam</a>, <a href=\"/products/jazz-collection\">Jazz</a>: textile soul, durable heart, elegant feel and PVC high performance.</li><li><strong>CHANCE 2.0 Classic</strong> — 236 colours, one iconic texture. Preview at the stand; samples follow with the launch of our new website.</li></ul><p><a href=\"/collections/office-fabrics-upholstery\">All office upholstery fabrics</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "healthcare": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "heart",
            "title": "Healthcare",
            "open": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>Clinics, care homes, medical equipment and patient seating.</strong> Easy-to-clean coated fabrics with antibacterial, antifungal and antiviral coatings, alcohol and bleach resistance, and biocompatibility to ISO 10993.</p><ul><li><strong>Chance Mediflex</strong> — <a href=\"/products/mediflex-collection\">Mediflex</a>: easy-to-clean finishing on a multilayer PVC coating, bielastic and non skin-irritant.</li><li><strong>Electra</strong> — <a href=\"/products/electra-collection\">Electra</a>: permanently antistatic, ESD-protective upholstery with a conductive network, for intensive care units, imaging rooms and operating theatres.</li></ul><p><a href=\"/collections/healthcare\">All healthcare upholstery fabrics</a></p>"
          }
        }
